<title>JAPAN: April Daqing price calculated $17.90/bbl--traders.</title>
<headline>April Daqing price calculated $17.90/bbl--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Daqing crude oil price for April lifting to Japanese customers has been calculated at $17.90 per barrel, down 98 cents from March, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
